  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St&#xf8;tte til uformel dialog mellem Indien-Pakistan-Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the grant is to contribute to confidence-building contacts and initiatives between India, Pakistan and Afghanistan by supporting networking and informal dialogue meetings on regional stability among retired senior officials from the three countries, a so-called Track II dialogue.</narrative>
